cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sundew: Energy-Constrained Autonomic Inference for Real-Time AI"
message: "If you use Sundew, please cite this software."
type: software
version: "0.4.1"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17118217
authors:
  - family-names: Idiakhoa
    given-names: Oluwafemi
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-7911-1171"
repository-code: "https://github.com/oluwafemidiakhoa/sundew_algorithms"
url: "https://oluwafemidiakhoa.github.io"
abstract: >
  Sundew is an energy-aware gating controller for real-time AI that allocates
  compute only when expected utility exceeds marginal cost. It provides
  selective activation, adaptive thresholds, and PI/MPC control with
  high energy-efficiency for edge deployments.
keywords:
  - energy-aware AI
  - adaptive computation
  - selective activation
  - gating
  - edge AI
  - real-time inference
